Alaska Microgrid Group, Inc. energy consulting service provides on-the-ground solutions. AMG is a non-profit organization established to support implementation of resilient, robust and affordable local power systems around the world - we provide Arctic expertise applicable worldwide.

AMG partners currently include utility operators and managers, developers, and researchers with decades of experience in building and operating microgrid projects across Alaska. Alaska has one of the highest concentrations of renewably-powered microgrid projects in the world and AlMG offers access to expertise developed over decades of successful development in some of the most challenging and remote environments in the world.

