Engaging in the research and development of clean, green, renewable energy systems in the Hawaiian Islands and Asia/Pacific region.  

•  Pono is a Hawaiian word commonly meaning "righteousness".  For example, the Hawai’i state motto: Ua Mau ke Ea o ka ʻĀina i ka Pono or "The life of the land is perpetuated in righteousness";

•  Pono is a term having many meanings, such as:  Goodness, positive, having morally beneficial qualities; accurate, correct and/or proper procedure, excellence, well-being, prosperous, equity, true condition or nature, duty, fitting, virtuous, fair, successful, in perfect order, eased, relieved, should, ought, must, necessary;  

•  Pono has a strong cultural and spiritual meaning, as in "achieving a state of harmony or balance";  

•  Pono is often used as an affirmative declaration in prayer, especially in the Native Hawaiian Community healing arts;

•  Pono also means, "to take responsibility for, update or prepare for the future" something, (or someone), that has been misused, misguided or neglected for some period of time.   

Pono Energy Systems endeavors to bring what is productive, beneficial, sustainable and carbon neutral to electrical power generation and use in the Hawaiian Islands and Asia/Pacific region.

Introduction;
The Hope Water Services is a Not-For-Profit organization aimed to increase agricultural production to eradicate poverty amidst Climate Change impacts of Prolonged Dry Spells and Unpredictable rainfall which resulted in poor yield and hence severe food insecurity in Norther Uganda especially in Adjumani District. This affected both Nationals and Refugees.
To achieve this the Hope Water Services is focused to serve less privileged communities by using Clean Energy Technology to supply water for irrigation to eradicate Poverty by providing Sustainable Agriculture under strict Environmental Protection approaches.

Our Vision;
Self-reliant, vibrant and enterprising communities engaged in sustainable development using reliable water supplies to improve agricultural production.

Our Mission;
To mobilise resources to facilitate poverty-stricken communities with clean energy water supplies to increase agricultural production to ensure food security and improve the general standard of living.
